Z||000000||lowCG||08-04-2001||01:02 PM||||Found a website that offers the critical dimensions of many car's rotors;quite handy when the only other option is to crawl around in a dark wharehouse with a set of calipers!<BR>The rotors I'm using are the Subaru 10.7" ones(vented),and if I'd gotten the 17' wheels,the SVX's 12.9" rotors would work even better,giving more room for a caliper mounting adapter(major plus).<BR>Everything's mounted onto my car,am just waiting to get down to the brake line shop to get all of that stuff,and also a new master cylinder.||||reg||10
